WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.341
[ominous music playing]

2
00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:10.927
[Gu-cheon] <i>Princess! Princess!</i>

3
00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.142
[squelching]

4
00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:21.187
[Gu-cheon breathing heavily]

5
00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:24.524
Is it tormenting you
to learn of the bloodshed

6
00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:26.901
caused by your family 30 years past?

7
00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:29.654
Do you despise your parents so deeply
that you would abandon your mind

8
00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:31.156
<i>and surrender your body?</i>

9
00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:34.325
<i>Your mother came to me.</i>

10
00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:36.661
She appeared to me
and pleaded for me to save her daughter.

11
00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.416
[groans]

12
00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.211
[stirring music playing]

13
00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:51.176
[Gu-cheon] <i>And… I learned the truth</i>
<i>about your father.</i>

14
00:00:55.138 --> 00:00:57.891
<i>How could a mere court lady</i>
<i>refuse a command like that?</i>

15
00:00:57.974 --> 00:01:01.770
<i>Royal Noble Consort Sukbin Choi</i>
<i>forced your mother to do those deeds.</i>

16
00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:10.987
Your father saved your mother
by marrying her.

17
00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:13.740
So don't turn your hatred upon
your mother or your father!

18
00:01:15.325 --> 00:01:19.537
Do not allow that hatred
to be exploited by the spirit. Princess!

19
00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:21.915
<i>Princess!</i>

20
00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:24.793
<i>Princess!</i>

21
00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:26.336
[woman] <i>Princess.</i>

22
00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:28.880
What has caught hold of your gaze?

23
00:01:28.963 --> 00:01:30.965
[music fades]

24
00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.636
Are these the blossoms
of the ginger tree. Mother?

25
00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:36.262
-Yes. my dear.
-[gentle music playing]

26
00:01:37.013 --> 00:01:39.265
They grow in abundance
back in my hometown.

27
00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:41.976
When I shared this with His Majesty.

28
00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:44.938
he bestowed it upon you
as your childhood namesake.

29
00:01:47.482 --> 00:01:50.110
Do you sometimes miss your homeland?

30
00:01:50.693 --> 00:01:51.694
I don't.

31
00:01:53.196 --> 00:01:54.864
There are no happy memories there.

32
00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:57.659
My father died very young.

33
00:01:58.159 --> 00:02:00.161
And my mother was often unwell.

34
00:02:03.331 --> 00:02:04.833
[young Saeng-gang] Then. Mother.

35
00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:08.169
please be born as my daughter
in your next life.

36
00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:11.214
That way. I will keep you safe.

37
00:02:16.427 --> 00:02:18.930
That is a wonderful and special idea.

38
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:26.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

39
00:02:27.105 --> 00:02:29.107
[music fades]

40
00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:31.067
-[squelching]
-[gasps]

41
00:02:31.151 --> 00:02:32.485
[Gu-cheon grunts]

42
00:02:32.569 --> 00:02:34.821
-[tense music playing]
-[both grunt]

43
00:02:34.904 --> 00:02:35.905
[Saeng-gang gasps]

44
00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.199
[panting]

45
00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:41.286
-[man 1] How did that…
-[Saeng-gang groans]

46
00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:44.080
-[man 1] Are you all right?
-[man 2] Your Majesty!

47
00:02:44.164 --> 00:02:45.248
How did that happen?

48
00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:47.375
-Are you all right?
-Is anyone out there?

49
00:02:47.458 --> 00:02:49.752
-Is there no one to help?
-Bring something for the wound!

50
00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.296
[woman 2] Your Highness!

51
00:02:51.379 --> 00:02:53.006
Go check outside.

52
00:02:53.089 --> 00:02:55.008
-Right now.
-Yes. Your Majesty.

53
00:02:55.717 --> 00:02:57.719
[panicked chattering]

54
00:02:58.720 --> 00:02:59.929
[door rattling]

55
00:03:00.013 --> 00:03:01.264
[man 1] Chief Eunuch Kim.

56
00:03:07.645 --> 00:03:08.938
What is going on?

57
00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:11.024
[breathing heavily]

58
00:03:12.233 --> 00:03:13.276
[grunts]

59
00:03:13.818 --> 00:03:14.903
[groans]

60
00:03:15.987 --> 00:03:17.363
[groans]

61
00:03:18.281 --> 00:03:19.991
[Saeng-gang breathing heavily]

62
00:03:20.074 --> 00:03:21.534
[Gu-cheon] Are you all right?

63
00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:26.164
Has your sight returned? How?

64
00:03:26.247 --> 00:03:27.665
We must stop the bleeding first.

65
00:03:34.088 --> 00:03:35.173
That was far too close.

66
00:03:35.256 --> 00:03:38.509
It's a good thing the Crown Prince fled
as soon as you woke up.

67
00:03:38.593 --> 00:03:40.720
[Saeng-gang breathing heavily]

68
00:03:40.803 --> 00:03:42.472
I was a complete and utter fool.

69
00:03:43.139 --> 00:03:44.891
I allowed the Crown Prince

70
00:03:45.475 --> 00:03:48.770
to overcome the ward
and use me as its vessel.

71
00:03:48.853 --> 00:03:50.647
We should take you to the physician.

72
00:03:54.275 --> 00:03:55.276
First though…

73
00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:58.947
Where did you see my mother?

74
00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:02.200
I would like to speak with her.

75
00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:06.663
I must tell her that I will release
her lingering resentment. and that…

76
00:04:07.163 --> 00:04:10.250
that I will be all right.
and she should go to the afterlife.

77
00:04:11.834 --> 00:04:13.086
She can't do that now.

78
00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:16.714
-She can still pass on.
-Not anymore.

79
00:04:16.798 --> 00:04:19.717
Her soul was devoured
by a gwi-mae on the other side.

80
00:04:19.801 --> 00:04:21.344
[stirring melancholy music playing]

81
00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:22.303
What. um…

82
00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:24.764
What does that mean?

83
00:04:24.847 --> 00:04:26.224
Your mother's soul

84
00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:29.185
was obliterated in the other world.

85
00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:33.690
-[snarls]
-[Gu-cheon grunts]

86
00:04:35.024 --> 00:04:36.025
[Gu-cheon panting]

87
00:04:38.194 --> 00:04:40.113
[panicked scream]

88
00:04:41.572 --> 00:04:42.407
[gasps]

89
00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:45.660
[grunts] Go to Saeng-gang now!

90
00:04:45.743 --> 00:04:47.078
I will be fine!

91
00:04:47.161 --> 00:04:49.580
So go now. please. Protect my daughter!

92
00:04:49.664 --> 00:04:51.374
Save Saeng-gang! I beg you.

93
00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:52.458
[gasps]

94
00:04:53.167 --> 00:04:55.670
[panicked scream]

95
00:04:58.464 --> 00:04:59.507
I am sorry.

96
00:05:19.068 --> 00:05:21.487
[pants. moans]

97
00:05:22.405 --> 00:05:24.407
[breathing shakily]

98
00:05:34.792 --> 00:05:36.252
[chuckles]

99
00:05:49.223 --> 00:05:50.558
[Saeng-gang sobs]

100
00:05:56.397 --> 00:05:57.857
[Saeng-gang crying]

101
00:06:09.744 --> 00:06:11.746
[Saeng-gang crying]

102
00:06:17.251 --> 00:06:22.173
THE EAST PALACE

103
00:06:22.256 --> 00:06:23.508
[music fades]

104
00:06:23.591 --> 00:06:26.094
The Princess came to see me last night.

105
00:06:27.303 --> 00:06:29.055
According to the eunuchs.

106
00:06:29.639 --> 00:06:31.849
she acted in a most unusual manner.

107
00:06:31.933 --> 00:06:35.311
It's nothing to worry about.
You need not be concerned with her.

108
00:06:36.396 --> 00:06:38.898
What's important is
I must go outside the palace

109
00:06:38.981 --> 00:06:41.109
if I'm to send
the Crown Prince's soul to the afterlife.

110
00:06:41.192 --> 00:06:44.862
There's no more need for that.
Do not send the soul to the afterlife.

111
00:06:45.446 --> 00:06:46.447
Obliterate it.

112
00:06:49.659 --> 00:06:51.369
Do you know what it means to do that?

113
00:06:52.912 --> 00:06:54.247
To obliterate someone's soul?

114
00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:55.331
It does not matter.

115
00:06:55.415 --> 00:06:58.543
You won't be leaving these walls at all.

116
00:06:59.377 --> 00:07:01.963
-The Princess can do it in your stead.
-I won't allow it.

117
00:07:02.547 --> 00:07:04.590
I will urge the Princess
to withdraw from this.

118
00:07:04.674 --> 00:07:05.967
It'll be too dangerous.

119
00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:09.262
But you said we shouldn't worry.

120
00:07:15.726 --> 00:07:19.105
So then something did occur
with the Princess.

121
00:07:19.689 --> 00:07:20.523
And…

122
00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:26.404
something happened to you as well.

123
00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:39.000
She was given to you
because she can hear the spirits' voices.

124
00:07:39.834 --> 00:07:43.421
The Princess has her uses.
You'll keep acting together.

125
00:07:43.504 --> 00:07:46.174
I have clearly stated to you
that the Princess is in danger. perhaps--

126
00:07:46.257 --> 00:07:49.302
Do not overstep your place by fretting
over the safety of the Princess.

127
00:07:49.385 --> 00:07:51.429
or have you forgotten your lowly station.

128
00:07:51.512 --> 00:07:53.806
and now she has become
an object of your desire?

129
00:07:54.307 --> 00:07:56.225
[melancholy string music playing]

130
00:07:56.309 --> 00:07:57.685
No. of course not.

131
00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.606
She was starting to get in the way.

132
00:08:02.315 --> 00:08:03.524
I simply want her to be gone.

133
00:08:04.984 --> 00:08:08.154
The closer she gets to
the Crown Prince's secret. Your Majesty.

134
00:08:08.863 --> 00:08:12.533
the closer she gets to uncovering
more secrets of the royal family.

135
00:08:12.617 --> 00:08:15.161
and her heart
can no longer bear the weight.

136
00:08:15.828 --> 00:08:17.455
[breathes heavily]

137
00:08:23.002 --> 00:08:25.004
[melancholy string music continues]

138
00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:37.058
[Gu-cheon sighs]

139
00:08:38.726 --> 00:08:40.436
[Saeng-gang] Why are you still here?

140
00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:44.982
Just in case you got possessed.

141
00:08:51.697 --> 00:08:52.782
[Gu-cheon sighs]

142
00:08:53.783 --> 00:08:55.076
Can you tell me now?

143
00:08:55.159 --> 00:08:58.287
Your eyes… What happened to you?

144
00:08:58.371 --> 00:08:59.830
[music fades]

145
00:09:00.623 --> 00:09:02.750
I obtained the eyes of a gwi-mae.

146
00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:04.043
The eyes of a gwi-mae?

147
00:09:04.126 --> 00:09:05.920
What happens to you now?

148
00:09:07.171 --> 00:09:10.258
Don't concern yourself with that.
Just hold on to this. please.

149
00:09:11.133 --> 00:09:12.718
Don't be careless and lose it.

150
00:09:13.928 --> 00:09:16.973
And you don't need to concern yourself
with the Crown Prince's spirit anymore.

151
00:09:17.682 --> 00:09:19.183
With my sight restored.

152
00:09:20.184 --> 00:09:21.978
I'll deal with the spirit on my own.

153
00:09:22.061 --> 00:09:24.689
-Why are you being like this?
-Because you get in the way.

154
00:09:27.817 --> 00:09:30.570
You may lose your body
to the Crown Prince once more.

155
00:09:33.364 --> 00:09:36.242
Taking care of you
has nearly made my intestines fall out.

156
00:09:36.325 --> 00:09:37.368
Gu-cheon.

157
00:09:41.581 --> 00:09:42.957
[Gu-cheon sighs]

158
00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.750
[exhales. groans]

159
00:09:50.047 --> 00:09:51.841
[Saeng-gang] Is this because of my mother?

160
00:09:53.801 --> 00:09:55.094
If it's about that…

161
00:09:57.597 --> 00:09:58.806
don't be troubled.

162
00:10:00.266 --> 00:10:02.810
She met her end while trying to save me.

163
00:10:02.893 --> 00:10:04.979
You have no reason to feel guilty.

164
00:10:05.813 --> 00:10:07.607
It's not your fault what happened to her.

165
00:10:10.192 --> 00:10:12.612
-Do you hear me at all?
-It is my fault.

166
00:10:12.695 --> 00:10:14.905
[tender music playing]

167
00:10:14.989 --> 00:10:16.449
Even before that…

168
00:10:18.659 --> 00:10:21.871
there was a soul that was devoured
by a gwi-mae seeking my yin energy.

169
00:10:23.664 --> 00:10:26.000
So you should just stay away from me.

170
00:10:27.293 --> 00:10:30.588
Who knows what may happen to you
if you stay with someone so cursed.

171
00:10:42.516 --> 00:10:44.060
[music intensifies]

172
00:11:02.995 --> 00:11:04.330
[Gu-cheon] <i>Never again</i>

173
00:11:05.706 --> 00:11:08.376
<i>will I lose anyone because of my actions.</i>

174
00:11:11.462 --> 00:11:13.422
[music fades]

175
00:11:13.506 --> 00:11:16.258
[Saeng-gang] Did you bring those wards
from your private residence?

176
00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:19.637
You brought a lot of them with you.

177
00:11:20.471 --> 00:11:21.722
You can go now.

178
00:11:21.806 --> 00:11:23.683
[woman 1 and 2] Yes. Your Majesty.

179
00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:28.062
[uneasy music playing]

180
00:11:28.854 --> 00:11:32.191
[Sukbin] Where did you suddenly
run off to last night. Saeng-gang?

181
00:11:32.274 --> 00:11:33.567
[door opens]

182
00:11:33.651 --> 00:11:35.695
Kneel down. will you?

183
00:11:35.778 --> 00:11:37.071
-Closer.
-[door closes]

184
00:11:38.155 --> 00:11:41.242
Come. my child. [laughs]

185
00:11:45.204 --> 00:11:47.915
Once again. you and I must go back

186
00:11:47.998 --> 00:11:50.584
to the inseparable grandmother
and granddaughter that we were.

187
00:11:50.668 --> 00:11:54.630
and with you. I will be able
to keep our family unharmed

188
00:11:55.131 --> 00:11:58.801
so we can guard our family secret
that took place 30 years ago.

189
00:11:58.884 --> 00:12:00.720
[chuckles] Oh.

190
00:12:01.303 --> 00:12:04.473
Someone has already started to notice
the mess you've caused.

191
00:12:06.308 --> 00:12:08.644
[woman] Your Highness.
your presence is urgently requested

192
00:12:08.728 --> 00:12:10.646
at the Queen Dowager's quarters.

193
00:12:13.649 --> 00:12:15.860
[Chief Eunuch]
His Majesty the King has arrived.

194
00:12:15.943 --> 00:12:17.945
[unsettling music continues]

195
00:12:28.164 --> 00:12:29.123
[door closes]

196
00:12:41.135 --> 00:12:42.303
You may all sit.

197
00:12:49.101 --> 00:12:51.312
You summoned even the royal kin.

198
00:12:51.395 --> 00:12:53.647
For what urgent matter have you called me?

199
00:12:54.398 --> 00:12:57.276
I do not have the leisure to sit
and enjoy refreshments at present.

200
00:12:57.359 --> 00:12:59.111
[Queen] Thirty years ago.

201
00:13:00.529 --> 00:13:04.366
while the late King's sons
met their untimely deaths.

202
00:13:04.867 --> 00:13:09.830
I wish for you to tell me how it happened
that only you. out of them. survived.

203
00:13:10.706 --> 00:13:12.708
[King laughing]

204
00:13:13.959 --> 00:13:15.961
[unsettling music continues]

205
00:13:16.462 --> 00:13:18.339
Has my own survival

206
00:13:20.007 --> 00:13:23.260
truly displeased you all this time.
my dear Mother?

207
00:13:23.344 --> 00:13:28.098
I am simply asking you to clarify
how you escaped the pond spirit's curse.

208
00:13:28.599 --> 00:13:29.892
Can you explain?

209
00:13:29.975 --> 00:13:33.103
At the time. I took refuge in the temple
of a renowned monk who exorcized spirits.

210
00:13:33.187 --> 00:13:34.522
But you are aware of that. Mother.

211
00:13:34.605 --> 00:13:36.023
No!

212
00:13:36.565 --> 00:13:39.151
I am aware that there was no need for that

213
00:13:39.235 --> 00:13:41.737
since there was no spirit there
to begin with.

214
00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:47.284
The Princes' deaths 30 years ago
were not the work of some pond spirit.

215
00:13:47.368 --> 00:13:48.994
That is clear.

216
00:13:49.703 --> 00:13:52.665
This case of poisoning
was carried out by a mortal.

217
00:13:52.748 --> 00:13:54.917
-Bring forth Inha!
-[door opens]

218
00:14:07.847 --> 00:14:11.517
[Queen] Prince Inha collapsed
as soon as he entered the palace.

219
00:14:12.351 --> 00:14:15.062
And something was found
in his quarters beside him.

220
00:14:19.149 --> 00:14:22.486
The confectionery box.
which Prince Inha ate from.

221
00:14:22.987 --> 00:14:24.530
And one more thing.

222
00:14:25.489 --> 00:14:27.992
It was given to me by the Princess.

223
00:14:28.701 --> 00:14:30.619
Her mother is also said to have died

224
00:14:30.703 --> 00:14:33.914
after eating food
from a lotus-patterned confectionery box.

225
00:14:34.582 --> 00:14:36.834
This is clear evidence
that the Princes' deaths

226
00:14:36.917 --> 00:14:38.377
were not the work of the pond spirit.

227
00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:42.381
but the acts of someone poisoning
the royal bloodline.

228
00:14:42.464 --> 00:14:45.301
What do you think of this. Your Majesty?

229
00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:49.138
Are you saying…

230
00:14:51.891 --> 00:14:55.227
that I killed my very own brothers
by poisoning them one by one?

231
00:14:55.311 --> 00:14:56.979
When everyone else is killed.

232
00:14:57.062 --> 00:15:01.066
naturally. the sole survivor
becomes the main culprit.

233
00:15:01.150 --> 00:15:03.736
And those actions allowed you
to be on the throne.

234
00:15:03.819 --> 00:15:07.031
A throne that you could never
have claimed. Your Majesty.

235
00:15:07.114 --> 00:15:09.867
[King] Are you willing
to stand behind the words you speak…

236
00:15:12.786 --> 00:15:15.456
and bear their weight. Your Majesty?

237
00:15:15.956 --> 00:15:17.750
[music fades]

238
00:15:34.808 --> 00:15:36.518
What are you doing. Your Majesty?

239
00:15:42.441 --> 00:15:43.776
Your Majesty.

240
00:15:45.277 --> 00:15:46.445
[man 1] But that is…

241
00:15:46.528 --> 00:15:47.613
Goodness.

242
00:15:47.696 --> 00:15:48.906
[Iksang gasps]

243
00:15:48.989 --> 00:15:50.991
[crunching]

244
00:16:00.376 --> 00:16:01.627
[King sighs]

245
00:16:02.586 --> 00:16:03.921
[man 2 clears throat]

246
00:16:06.173 --> 00:16:08.175
[unsettling music playing]

247
00:16:08.759 --> 00:16:10.761
[crunching continues]

248
00:16:38.497 --> 00:16:39.456
[groans]

249
00:16:53.679 --> 00:16:55.305
[King] You claimed it was poisoned.

250
00:16:55.389 --> 00:16:57.850
We will have our proof in time.
will we not?

251
00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:02.271
Oh…

252
00:17:04.064 --> 00:17:06.608
-Chief Eunuch.
-Yes. Your Majesty.

253
00:17:06.692 --> 00:17:08.861
[unsettling music intensifies]

254
00:17:08.944 --> 00:17:11.447
Take Prince Inha
outside the palace right this minute.

255
00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:13.490
Outside the palace in this state?

256
00:17:15.159 --> 00:17:16.910
Something has piqued my curiosity.

257
00:17:19.538 --> 00:17:21.165
[Chief Eunuch] Stop here!

258
00:17:29.465 --> 00:17:32.801
Your Majesty.
the moment we left the palace.

259
00:17:32.885 --> 00:17:35.179
the young prince regained consciousness.

260
00:17:35.262 --> 00:17:36.764
What is that?

261
00:17:36.847 --> 00:17:39.224
[Jang] And he asked us
to deliver a message to you.

262
00:17:39.308 --> 00:17:41.935
Wait! What did he say?

263
00:17:42.853 --> 00:17:45.689
That it was actually a spirit
that tried to kill him.

264
00:17:45.773 --> 00:17:48.150
It said that it would sever
the royal bloodline.

265
00:17:48.233 --> 00:17:49.109
[murmuring]

266
00:17:49.193 --> 00:17:50.944
[Queen] No. That cannot be.

267
00:17:51.028 --> 00:17:53.322
It must have been poison that did this.

268
00:17:53.405 --> 00:17:54.406
Poison?

269
00:17:55.157 --> 00:17:57.159
What nonsense is this?

270
00:17:57.659 --> 00:17:59.870
Are you saying that I. their father.

271
00:17:59.953 --> 00:18:03.499
am responsible for killing my sons
with my very hands?

272
00:18:06.585 --> 00:18:09.588
They were all killed by the pond spirit.

273
00:18:10.214 --> 00:18:14.009
The Most Favored Lady of the Court.
whom you put to death.

274
00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:16.095
No. no.

275
00:18:16.178 --> 00:18:17.387
[Queen breathes shakily]

276
00:18:17.471 --> 00:18:20.182
I held back
out of concern for your well-being.

277
00:18:20.265 --> 00:18:22.267
Now I simply have no other choice.

278
00:18:22.851 --> 00:18:26.021
You cruelly put
the pregnant favored court lady to death.

279
00:18:26.105 --> 00:18:29.691
completely severing the royal bloodline.
and branded me as a murderer.

280
00:18:29.775 --> 00:18:33.278
Your ruler. your King.
and the most sovereign of this nation!

281
00:18:33.362 --> 00:18:35.781
I will not tolerate this any longer!

282
00:18:39.076 --> 00:18:40.786
You are to leave the palace.

283
00:18:41.995 --> 00:18:43.163
At once.

284
00:18:43.247 --> 00:18:45.249
[tense music playing]

285
00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:50.671
[loud clattering]

286
00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:53.966
[groans]

287
00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:03.308
[Queen] How dare you command me!

288
00:19:03.809 --> 00:19:06.645
I already know the entire truth!
I know it all!

289
00:19:06.728 --> 00:19:10.440
This is all your doing!
I know the truth of it all!

290
00:19:10.524 --> 00:19:12.568
I know it all! [gasps]

291
00:19:12.651 --> 00:19:14.486
No. you bastard!

292
00:19:16.905 --> 00:19:19.533
[strained breathing]

293
00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:22.327
No. you do not.

294
00:19:23.787 --> 00:19:25.330
Because it was you.

295
00:19:25.414 --> 00:19:26.248
[Queen sobs]

296
00:19:26.331 --> 00:19:29.960
You are behind
all of the palace tragedies and curses.

297
00:19:30.919 --> 00:19:34.089
This all started because of you. Mother.

298
00:19:35.048 --> 00:19:38.093
I was dragged by you
into this miserable hell

299
00:19:38.177 --> 00:19:40.345
because of your pathetic actions.

300
00:19:42.139 --> 00:19:44.474
Now. it is time you accept it.

301
00:19:44.558 --> 00:19:46.643
-[Queen sobs]
-[King] Do you hear me?

302
00:19:46.727 --> 00:19:48.729
[Queen breathing shakily]

303
00:19:50.606 --> 00:19:52.858
This is your burden to bear.

304
00:19:54.067 --> 00:19:55.527
Your karma. Mother.

305
00:20:08.624 --> 00:20:10.584
[tense music intensifies]

306
00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:16.798
I will never leave the palace. Not ever.

307
00:20:18.258 --> 00:20:21.970
I will not leave. not even in death!

308
00:20:22.596 --> 00:20:25.349
This palace belongs to me! It is mine!

309
00:20:25.432 --> 00:20:28.393
This palace is mine! It belongs to me!

310
00:20:28.477 --> 00:20:31.230
I will never leave here. Never!

311
00:20:31.313 --> 00:20:34.066
[Jang] Your Majesty. are you all right?
Please. calm yourself.

312
00:20:34.149 --> 00:20:36.568
-[Queen whining]
-[Jang] Your Majesty.

313
00:20:37.486 --> 00:20:39.404
[Saeng-gang gasps] Father! Wait!

314
00:20:45.869 --> 00:20:47.037
[Chief Eunuch] Let us leave.

315
00:20:55.754 --> 00:20:58.090
You willingly released
the spirit of the Crown Prince?

316
00:20:58.173 --> 00:21:01.677
You took Prince Inha as your adopted son.
despite knowing the spirit would harm him.

317
00:21:02.386 --> 00:21:04.096
How could you have done this?

318
00:21:04.179 --> 00:21:05.973
Is your mind your own. Saeng-gang?

319
00:21:06.807 --> 00:21:09.268
And who are you today?

320
00:21:11.103 --> 00:21:12.980
Are you really the Princess?

321
00:21:13.063 --> 00:21:14.815
[wind whistles]

322
00:21:14.898 --> 00:21:17.985
Don't appear before me
until the pond spirit's been destroyed.

323
00:21:18.068 --> 00:21:19.945
I cannot place my trust in you until then.

324
00:21:20.028 --> 00:21:22.990
I. too. cannot place my trust in you
at the moment.

325
00:21:23.782 --> 00:21:25.784
[intriguing music playing]

326
00:21:27.077 --> 00:21:30.080
Father. why did
your first and second sons both die?

327
00:21:31.373 --> 00:21:33.041
Like the third one you buried.

328
00:21:33.792 --> 00:21:35.669
Were those two poisoned as well?

329
00:21:37.004 --> 00:21:39.673
The consequences of that sin
will come for you.

330
00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:42.676
It is inevitable.

331
00:21:46.346 --> 00:21:48.432
[uneasy music playing]

332
00:21:48.515 --> 00:21:49.391
Fine.

333
00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:53.186
Then I shall wait.

334
00:21:54.438 --> 00:21:55.605
[Saeng-gang scoffs]

335
00:21:56.982 --> 00:21:59.985
[breathes heavily]

336
00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:04.156
[Queen murmurs] The King…

337
00:22:04.656 --> 00:22:06.408
The King…

338
00:22:10.620 --> 00:22:15.042
I must kill the King.

339
00:22:15.125 --> 00:22:17.169
[unsettling music playing]

340
00:22:17.252 --> 00:22:19.129
-[Iksang] Come in.
-[door opens]

341
00:22:20.255 --> 00:22:23.967
[Queen] I must kill the King.

342
00:22:24.051 --> 00:22:26.011
[eerie dark music playing]

343
00:22:32.017 --> 00:22:35.062
[King] <i>Are you saying the plague</i>
<i>has reached the outskirts of the capital?</i>

344
00:22:35.145 --> 00:22:38.315
[man] We humbly apologize. Your Majesty.
All gates of the capital have been closed.

345
00:22:38.398 --> 00:22:40.484
and we have restricted anyone
from entering or leaving.

346
00:22:40.567 --> 00:22:41.526
[King sighs]

347
00:22:42.361 --> 00:22:45.030
The Jeonuigam.
the Hyeminseo. and the Hwalinseo

348
00:22:45.113 --> 00:22:48.867
are to report to me all measures in place
to contain the sickness at once.

349
00:22:49.368 --> 00:22:52.746
And release all of the grain reserves.
Make sure the Minister…

350
00:22:52.829 --> 00:22:54.247
[coughs]

351
00:22:54.331 --> 00:22:56.083
[tense music swells]

352
00:22:56.166 --> 00:22:58.168
-[Chief Eunuch] Your Majesty!
-[man 1] Your Majesty!

353
00:22:58.251 --> 00:23:00.253
-[King coughs. gasping]
-[Chief Eunuch] Your Majesty.

354
00:23:02.422 --> 00:23:05.175
Your Majesty. The plague has come.

355
00:23:06.051 --> 00:23:07.260
I will summon the physician.

356
00:23:07.844 --> 00:23:08.762
[King] No.

357
00:23:11.556 --> 00:23:13.475
Gu… Gu… Gu-cheon.

358
00:23:13.558 --> 00:23:15.644
[labored breathing]

359
00:23:15.727 --> 00:23:17.687
G… Gu-cheon. I need Gu-cheon.

360
00:23:17.771 --> 00:23:19.272
[groans] Now.

361
00:23:21.483 --> 00:23:23.360
-[tense music playing]
-[coughs]

362
00:23:23.443 --> 00:23:24.653
[groans. coughs]

363
00:23:24.736 --> 00:23:25.779
[man 2] Your Majesty.

364
00:23:27.364 --> 00:23:29.324
Your Majesty. Your Majesty.

365
00:23:29.408 --> 00:23:30.492
Your Majesty.

366
00:23:31.076 --> 00:23:32.119
Your Majesty.

367
00:23:33.286 --> 00:23:35.122
[King] Take a proper look at me.

368
00:23:43.088 --> 00:23:44.756
Tell me what you see.

369
00:23:44.840 --> 00:23:46.675
[dark. mysterious music playing]

370
00:23:46.758 --> 00:23:50.011
[Gu-cheon] This is unlike the spirits
I see here in the palace.

371
00:23:50.679 --> 00:23:53.640
I see people around you.
wailing in suffering.

372
00:23:54.474 --> 00:23:55.392
[girl] Please help us.

373
00:23:55.475 --> 00:23:57.352
[Gu-cheon] Their bodies are covered
in spots.

374
00:23:57.436 --> 00:24:01.106
And a child. around the same age
as Prince Yeongan. is by your side.

375
00:24:01.189 --> 00:24:03.525
clutching the hem of your shirt.
Your Majesty.

376
00:24:06.611 --> 00:24:08.405
So they're the villagers.

377
00:24:10.407 --> 00:24:12.576
The people with the plague you killed.

378
00:24:13.201 --> 00:24:17.747
Did they come to the palace…
bearing ill will against me?

379
00:24:18.248 --> 00:24:19.958
Won-gwis are remarkably simple.

380
00:24:20.041 --> 00:24:21.042
If they hold resentment.

381
00:24:21.126 --> 00:24:24.045
the soldiers who killed them
are the ones they'd go after.

382
00:24:26.256 --> 00:24:29.092
But instead. they chose the one
who gave the order. Your Majesty.

383
00:24:29.968 --> 00:24:32.304
Someone guided them to you
from the other realm.

384
00:24:34.097 --> 00:24:36.933
So the one
who brought the spirits here is…

385
00:24:37.017 --> 00:24:39.019
[tense music builds]

386
00:24:43.732 --> 00:24:44.941
It was the Crown Prince.

387
00:24:45.025 --> 00:24:46.568
[grunts. coughs]

388
00:24:46.651 --> 00:24:48.570
-[King coughing]
-[music fades]

389
00:24:56.495 --> 00:24:59.873
Then go… and resolve this to the end.

390
00:25:02.459 --> 00:25:04.628
What about all the spirits here?

391
00:25:05.629 --> 00:25:07.339
If they remain. you will be in danger.

392
00:25:08.715 --> 00:25:10.133
I will conduct a Yeoje rite.

393
00:25:10.217 --> 00:25:11.426
[tense music resumes]

394
00:25:11.510 --> 00:25:13.303
[King] I will have it performed
tomorrow night

395
00:25:14.179 --> 00:25:16.556
and have the spirits
driven out of here to end this.

396
00:25:16.640 --> 00:25:18.266
Driven out of here?

397
00:25:19.434 --> 00:25:23.522
That rite is for souls
who have died unjust deaths.

398
00:25:23.605 --> 00:25:26.316
An appeasement rite will surely fail
if performed with that mindset.

399
00:25:26.399 --> 00:25:28.026
You just focus
on the Crown Prince's spirit

400
00:25:28.109 --> 00:25:29.528
and how to get rid of it.

401
00:25:31.196 --> 00:25:33.782
The time we agreed upon draws near.

402
00:25:39.496 --> 00:25:41.039
[tense music swells]

403
00:25:42.958 --> 00:25:44.709
[spectral cries]

404
00:25:51.216 --> 00:25:53.218
[music intensifies]

405
00:26:09.109 --> 00:26:10.402
[crows squawk]

406
00:26:14.990 --> 00:26:17.117
[crows squeal]

407
00:26:19.703 --> 00:26:22.080
-[crows squawk]
-[music fades]

408
00:26:22.789 --> 00:26:23.957
What are you doing?

409
00:26:24.457 --> 00:26:26.209
Something calls.

410
00:26:26.293 --> 00:26:27.419
I hear it.

411
00:26:30.755 --> 00:26:31.840
What calls?

412
00:26:35.594 --> 00:26:36.428
Gu-cheon.

413
00:26:38.471 --> 00:26:39.723
It's nothing. Don't worry.

414
00:26:41.975 --> 00:26:43.184
[Saeng-gang] Be honest with me.

415
00:26:43.268 --> 00:26:46.271
Did your condition worsen
after you got the eyes of the gwi-mae?

416
00:26:47.022 --> 00:26:48.356
Why are you here?

417
00:26:49.441 --> 00:26:51.693
Did I not say that I would do this alone?

418
00:26:55.488 --> 00:26:57.449
[Saeng-gang] Is this
really how you're going to be?

419
00:26:59.492 --> 00:27:01.244
I told you.
my mother's soul being obliterated

420
00:27:01.328 --> 00:27:02.746
was my fault for getting possessed.

421
00:27:02.829 --> 00:27:04.414
None of it was your fault!

422
00:27:10.629 --> 00:27:13.131
I know you are doing this
out of concern for me.

423
00:27:13.673 --> 00:27:16.509
What's already happened
and whatever happens after tonight.

424
00:27:17.302 --> 00:27:19.095
I promise you right now.

425
00:27:20.055 --> 00:27:21.765
that is all my burden to bear.

426
00:27:22.265 --> 00:27:23.683
None of it's yours.

427
00:27:23.767 --> 00:27:25.769
[uneasy music playing]

428
00:27:30.565 --> 00:27:33.068
[Gu-cheon] <i>The Crown Prince's spirit</i>
<i>failed to approach the King.</i>

429
00:27:33.902 --> 00:27:37.238
<i>It's drawing the spirits of the villagers</i>
<i>with the plague into the palace.</i>

430
00:27:37.322 --> 00:27:39.699
[distorted voice]
I will draw them all to this place.

431
00:27:39.783 --> 00:27:41.618
[Gu-cheon] <i>The Crown Prince's spirit</i>

432
00:27:42.535 --> 00:27:44.871
<i>will surely seek out the King</i>
<i>and kill him.</i>

433
00:27:44.954 --> 00:27:47.165
[spectral voices]

434
00:27:47.248 --> 00:27:48.500
[Saeng-gang] <i>Draw them in…</i>

435
00:27:50.251 --> 00:27:52.754
[Gu-cheon] <i>I couldn't even protect</i>
<i>your mother's soul.</i>

436
00:27:54.422 --> 00:27:57.092
I mustn't allow your father
to be taken as well.

437
00:27:58.134 --> 00:27:59.302
[sighs]

438
00:28:02.514 --> 00:28:05.058
I should send you
out of this place to free you.

439
00:28:06.101 --> 00:28:07.811
but I need you in the palace.

440
00:28:09.104 --> 00:28:10.772
I can only depend on you.

441
00:28:10.855 --> 00:28:12.857
[gentle music playing]

442
00:28:14.818 --> 00:28:17.112
We will wait until the morning arrives

443
00:28:17.612 --> 00:28:19.531
so I can replenish my yang.

444
00:28:34.546 --> 00:28:37.006
[Saeng-gang]
I will share my yang energy with you.

445
00:28:54.774 --> 00:28:56.109
[Gu-cheon groans]

446
00:28:59.946 --> 00:29:01.948
-[skin tearing]
-[groans]

447
00:29:03.658 --> 00:29:05.660
[tense music playing]

448
00:29:06.953 --> 00:29:10.081
[Gu-cheon] <i>I will find out what he intends</i>
<i>to do with the plague spirits.</i>

449
00:29:11.332 --> 00:29:13.376
<i>but I need you to buy me some time.</i>

450
00:29:13.460 --> 00:29:15.462
[breathes shakily]

451
00:29:16.004 --> 00:29:18.923
[Gu-cheon] <i>First. write a spell.</i>
<i>coat it with chicken blood.</i>

452
00:29:19.007 --> 00:29:21.009
<i>and affix it to the King's bedchamber.</i>

453
00:29:23.136 --> 00:29:26.848
<i>That way. the Crown Prince</i>
<i>will not be able to approach easily.</i>

454
00:29:29.100 --> 00:29:32.812
<i>The King must be protected</i>
<i>until the Yeoje rite is held.</i>

455
00:29:32.896 --> 00:29:35.607
[dramatic percussive music playing]

456
00:29:39.611 --> 00:29:40.945
What are you doing here?

457
00:29:41.029 --> 00:29:43.448
Do not let anyone enter this chamber
from now on.

458
00:29:55.293 --> 00:29:57.587
[dramatic percussive music builds]

459
00:29:59.130 --> 00:30:00.799
[music subsides]

460
00:30:00.882 --> 00:30:03.343
I asked you a question.
Why have you come here suddenly?

461
00:30:03.426 --> 00:30:05.094
I did not wish to be here either.

462
00:30:05.178 --> 00:30:08.598
but I was told that I must protect you
until the Yeoje rite is held.

463
00:30:11.476 --> 00:30:14.312
So Gu-cheon has spoken to you. I see.

464
00:30:14.395 --> 00:30:16.397
[spectral voices. crying]

465
00:30:18.900 --> 00:30:21.528
[spectral voice] There is something
I must tell you. Your Majesty.

466
00:30:22.987 --> 00:30:23.863
What is it?

467
00:30:24.572 --> 00:30:25.782
[breathes shakily]

468
00:30:25.865 --> 00:30:30.036
There is… someone here
who is not a plague spirit.

469
00:30:30.578 --> 00:30:31.746
[spectral voice] Your Majesty.

470
00:30:32.747 --> 00:30:34.332
He's behind you. Father.

471
00:30:34.415 --> 00:30:35.834
[unsettling music playing]

472
00:30:35.917 --> 00:30:38.419
[spectral voice] There is something
you must know about the Crown Prince.

473
00:30:38.503 --> 00:30:39.879
Stay where you are.

474
00:30:39.963 --> 00:30:43.007
[spectral voice] Please. I beg you.
hear me out. Your Majesty.

475
00:30:46.427 --> 00:30:48.847
He says that he wishes to speak to you
about the Crown Prince.

476
00:30:48.930 --> 00:30:50.306
-No.
-[pounds table]

477
00:30:50.390 --> 00:30:52.392
-Do not listen.
-[spectral voice] Please. I beg you.

478
00:30:52.475 --> 00:30:54.644
What is it
that you are trying to keep hidden?

479
00:30:54.727 --> 00:30:57.230
-You are to leave at once. Now.
-No. I refuse.

480
00:30:58.147 --> 00:31:01.109
Father. you must speak for yourself.
You can't keep evading the truth.

481
00:31:01.192 --> 00:31:02.652
That's enough. Saeng-gang!

482
00:31:02.735 --> 00:31:05.697
Whatever it is that voice
so earnestly begs you to hear.

483
00:31:05.780 --> 00:31:07.490
-I will hear it speak.
-[loud clattering]

484
00:31:07.574 --> 00:31:09.325
[breathing heavily]

485
00:31:09.409 --> 00:31:11.953
-Do not come closer. Do not listen.
-[uneasy music playing]

486
00:31:12.036 --> 00:31:14.956
I said you are to learn nothing more
about this! Leave. now!

487
00:31:15.999 --> 00:31:17.667
-Leave this place at once!
-Father!

488
00:31:17.750 --> 00:31:19.752
[King sobs]

489
00:31:25.842 --> 00:31:28.386
[breathes shakily. sobs]

490
00:31:28.469 --> 00:31:29.637
[coughs]

491
00:31:30.263 --> 00:31:32.265
[gasps. coughs]

492
00:31:33.141 --> 00:31:35.435
[coughs]

493
00:31:39.272 --> 00:31:41.649
-[unsettling music playing]
-[breathing heavily]

494
00:31:47.447 --> 00:31:48.698
Who is speaking?

495
00:31:50.408 --> 00:31:53.828
You need to tell me honestly.
Did you kill him. Father?

496
00:31:56.080 --> 00:31:57.081
I commanded it.

497
00:31:59.792 --> 00:32:01.753
Why did you have him killed?

498
00:32:05.256 --> 00:32:06.424
He said that…

499
00:32:12.680 --> 00:32:14.849
he was trying to confess that he saw…

500
00:32:19.896 --> 00:32:21.731
what the Crown Prince had done.

501
00:32:28.279 --> 00:32:30.907
[unsettling music intensifies]

502
00:32:31.616 --> 00:32:32.825
[Crown Prince sighs]

503
00:32:33.409 --> 00:32:34.452
I see.

504
00:32:38.831 --> 00:32:41.042
This palace has always been

505
00:32:41.626 --> 00:32:43.795
the most interesting place.

506
00:32:45.546 --> 00:32:46.923
Would you not agree?

507
00:32:49.634 --> 00:32:51.636
[spectral voices]

508
00:32:55.390 --> 00:32:56.891
[Saeng-gang] Are you saying

509
00:32:57.767 --> 00:33:00.645
the Crown Prince could hear
the voices of spirits as well?

510
00:33:03.606 --> 00:33:05.608
-[music fades]
-[rain pattering]

511
00:33:18.121 --> 00:33:20.331
[King] I want you to tell me exactly

512
00:33:20.415 --> 00:33:22.792
how I. your father. became King.

513
00:33:26.379 --> 00:33:27.463
[clears throat]

514
00:33:29.215 --> 00:33:33.052
Because the late King's sons died
one after the other.

515
00:33:33.136 --> 00:33:35.304
And tell me the reason…

516
00:33:37.724 --> 00:33:39.308
why they all died?

517
00:33:42.770 --> 00:33:45.523
I was told
it was the curse of the pond spirit.

518
00:33:45.606 --> 00:33:46.816
[King sighs]

519
00:33:47.984 --> 00:33:49.527
Be honest with me.

520
00:33:51.279 --> 00:33:52.989
I don't understand what you mean.

521
00:33:53.072 --> 00:33:55.616
In our lineage.
there are children among the relatives

522
00:33:55.700 --> 00:33:58.077
on my mother's side of the family

523
00:33:58.161 --> 00:34:02.081
who are born with a cursed ability
our ancestors had passed down.

524
00:34:02.165 --> 00:34:04.083
and you have that ability.

525
00:34:04.167 --> 00:34:05.752
[uneasy music playing]

526
00:34:05.835 --> 00:34:07.670
You can hear the voices. can you not?

527
00:34:08.838 --> 00:34:13.301
So you must have known in advance
that the pond spirit never even existed

528
00:34:13.384 --> 00:34:16.679
and how it wasn't a spirit
who killed the late King's sons.

529
00:34:20.099 --> 00:34:22.310
But. in fact. it was a human.

530
00:34:24.312 --> 00:34:26.397
[breathing heavily]

531
00:34:26.481 --> 00:34:27.482
Your Majesty!

532
00:34:27.565 --> 00:34:28.566
[King] And yet.

533
00:34:29.692 --> 00:34:32.653
my first and second sons
have died as well.

534
00:34:33.196 --> 00:34:36.657
They both died.
even though no such spirit ever existed.

535
00:34:37.617 --> 00:34:40.953
They vomited black blood.
just as my brothers did.

536
00:34:42.789 --> 00:34:43.831
Meaning…

537
00:34:45.541 --> 00:34:49.128
you must have heard the secret
from 30 years ago

538
00:34:50.213 --> 00:34:51.923
and reenacted it.

539
00:35:02.433 --> 00:35:05.561
Did you really think
that I'd let you get away with it?

540
00:35:05.645 --> 00:35:07.647
[uneasy music intensifies]

541
00:35:20.076 --> 00:35:21.160
Did you…

542
00:35:23.871 --> 00:35:26.249
Did you really poison this?

543
00:35:30.253 --> 00:35:31.462
[gasps]

544
00:35:33.047 --> 00:35:34.465
How could this happen?

545
00:35:35.133 --> 00:35:38.136
How could a father
kill his own children by poison?

546
00:35:38.761 --> 00:35:41.973
You can never become the King
and rule the people of this land.

547
00:35:42.056 --> 00:35:44.183
I will not allow you
to ever realize that agenda.

548
00:35:44.267 --> 00:35:45.351
[screams] Why?

549
00:35:46.644 --> 00:35:49.438
That's how you became King yourself.
so why?

550
00:35:50.231 --> 00:35:52.942
Why is it that I am not allowed
to ever be King. huh?

551
00:35:53.025 --> 00:35:54.235
[laughs]

552
00:35:54.318 --> 00:35:55.611
[coughs]

553
00:35:56.612 --> 00:35:58.447
[chokes]

554
00:36:03.786 --> 00:36:05.037
[gasps]

555
00:36:08.541 --> 00:36:09.667
[chokes]

556
00:36:11.294 --> 00:36:14.046
We do not need
another brother killer to be King.

557
00:36:15.548 --> 00:36:17.633
That role is mine alone.

558
00:36:20.887 --> 00:36:22.096
You. too…

559
00:36:22.638 --> 00:36:23.890
[music subsides]

560
00:36:24.974 --> 00:36:27.768
…will be known as having died
by the curse of the pond spirit.

561
00:36:29.854 --> 00:36:31.939
Yes. do as you wish.

562
00:36:32.607 --> 00:36:33.733
[pants]

563
00:36:33.816 --> 00:36:36.068
[tense dramatic music playing]

564
00:36:40.239 --> 00:36:42.366
[gasps. coughs]

565
00:36:42.450 --> 00:36:43.492
[body thuds]

566
00:36:44.035 --> 00:36:47.121
[gasping]

567
00:36:50.333 --> 00:36:53.294
Oh. my father.
since you are the pond spirit…

568
00:36:53.377 --> 00:36:54.337
[gasps]

569
00:36:54.962 --> 00:36:58.382
…it is only fitting
that I die by the spirit's hand.

570
00:36:59.091 --> 00:37:01.093
[coughs. wheezes]

571
00:37:03.971 --> 00:37:05.973
And when I do die. Father…

572
00:37:10.228 --> 00:37:14.190
I will become the true
and now very real pond spirit.

573
00:37:16.525 --> 00:37:18.736
[laughs. wheezes]

574
00:37:21.072 --> 00:37:22.907
[gasping]

575
00:37:26.953 --> 00:37:28.120
[Crown Prince] Father!

576
00:37:30.790 --> 00:37:32.333
[Crown Price gasps loudly]

577
00:37:33.834 --> 00:37:37.421
[Crown Prince] As the curse decreed
30 years ago…

578
00:37:38.965 --> 00:37:40.299
[gasps]

579
00:37:41.842 --> 00:37:47.181
…I will completely sever
the royal bloodline.

580
00:37:50.268 --> 00:37:54.647
If I… cannot be the king someday…

581
00:38:00.069 --> 00:38:01.821
[King groans]

582
00:38:03.114 --> 00:38:04.865
-[groans]
-Father?

583
00:38:04.949 --> 00:38:06.200
[groans]

584
00:38:06.284 --> 00:38:08.286
[tense rhythmic music playing]

585
00:38:12.206 --> 00:38:13.916
[gasps. groans]

586
00:38:14.000 --> 00:38:15.501
[Saeng-gang breathing heavily]

587
00:38:15.584 --> 00:38:16.460
[echoes] Father.

588
00:38:16.961 --> 00:38:17.920
Father!

589
00:38:18.838 --> 00:38:20.840
[spectral voices]

590
00:38:22.341 --> 00:38:26.887
[Crown Prince] <i>Then you. too.</i>
<i>cannot be the King. Father.</i>

591
00:38:26.971 --> 00:38:28.973
[tense dramatic music playing]

592
00:38:41.694 --> 00:38:42.945
[gasping breath]

593
00:38:45.948 --> 00:38:48.701
[spectral screaming]

594
00:38:52.621 --> 00:38:54.415
[gasping breath]

595
00:38:54.498 --> 00:38:56.000
[music swells]

596
00:38:58.336 --> 00:39:02.840
[shaman] May peace fill this house
and harmony be fulfilled!

597
00:39:02.923 --> 00:39:07.136
With one heart.
we offer this solemn prayer!

598
00:39:07.219 --> 00:39:09.847
Your Royal Highness.
who is the householder deity.

599
00:39:09.930 --> 00:39:12.099
take our gifts to you!

600
00:39:12.183 --> 00:39:14.560
Even though. Crown Prince.
we've not much to offer.

601
00:39:14.643 --> 00:39:17.355
please partake in this meal
and drive away the plague spirits

602
00:39:17.438 --> 00:39:18.898
from this palace!

603
00:39:18.981 --> 00:39:20.691
[tense dramatic music continues]

604
00:39:23.027 --> 00:39:25.029
[screaming]

605
00:39:30.076 --> 00:39:32.328
[Gu-cheon] Is he devouring human souls
like a gwi-mae?

606
00:39:32.912 --> 00:39:34.455
Stop that at once!

607
00:39:34.538 --> 00:39:35.915
[spectral screaming]

608
00:39:35.998 --> 00:39:37.124
[Gu-cheon grunts]

609
00:39:41.045 --> 00:39:42.338
[grunting]

610
00:39:45.132 --> 00:39:47.134
[squelching]

611
00:39:48.886 --> 00:39:50.888
[spectral screaming continues]

612
00:39:53.974 --> 00:39:55.976
[crunching]

613
00:39:56.602 --> 00:39:58.145
[screaming]

614
00:39:59.605 --> 00:40:00.898
[screaming stops. gasps]

615
00:40:00.981 --> 00:40:02.650
[moans]

616
00:40:02.733 --> 00:40:05.236
-[spectral screaming]
-[moans]

617
00:40:05.319 --> 00:40:07.321
[wind whistling]

618
00:40:11.909 --> 00:40:13.619
[Crown Prince moans]

619
00:40:13.702 --> 00:40:16.539
[wind whistling]

620
00:40:21.710 --> 00:40:23.379
[gasps]

621
00:40:23.462 --> 00:40:25.464
[tense dramatic music continues]

622
00:40:30.428 --> 00:40:32.012
Does that mean…

623
00:40:34.348 --> 00:40:36.225
His Majesty's dead?

624
00:40:36.892 --> 00:40:37.768
[Saeng-gang] Father.

625
00:40:38.269 --> 00:40:39.103
Father!

626
00:40:39.186 --> 00:40:40.479
[panicked breathing]

627
00:40:41.397 --> 00:40:43.524
[squelching]

628
00:40:43.607 --> 00:40:44.608
[breathes shakily]

629
00:40:50.698 --> 00:40:51.907
Gu-cheon!

630
00:40:54.994 --> 00:40:56.996
[music intensifies]

631
00:41:06.338 --> 00:41:08.174
[pants]

632
00:41:10.301 --> 00:41:12.136
[squelching]

633
00:41:20.102 --> 00:41:21.729
[breathing echoes]

634
00:41:21.812 --> 00:41:23.814
{\an8}[epic rock music playing]

635
00:44:18.656 --> 00:44:20.282
[music fades]

636
00:44:21.305 --> 00:45:21.244
